    {
      "id": "BG-002",
      "title": "Saved Evidence Boundary",
      "description": "A separate simulated relevance source supplies device/ACL pairs for the query's two IP addresses, and supplied snapshots provide stored rule evidence. Relevance order does not represent a real network path, saved evidence does not establish live truth, and no SLA or freshness TTL is specified.",
