      "title": "Bounded Prototype Scope",
      "description": "Provide only the local CLI prototype, without networking, web or HTTP interfaces, authentication, interactive UI, live routing, real-device collection, full vendor parsing, databases or production history storage. Continuous services, distributed workers, queues, CQRS, event buses, DI frameworks and production dependencies are outside scope.",
